  "reasoning": "The defendants stole and cut public road‑lamp cables, which are public utility property. Their conduct constitutes theft of public property (盗窃) and also the intentional damage to a public utility that endangers safety, which is covered by the crime of destroying power/electric facilities (破坏电力设施). Both offenses are reflected in the prosecution’s description.",
